  "description": "\"I... got a boner\" is what Ji-Hyun blurts out the first time he lays eyes on Yo-Han's handsome face... It's easy to get laid when you're a pretty, sassy bartender working at a popular gay bar. This lifestyle suits Ji-Hyun just fine since he loves casual hookups without any intimacy… That is until he meets Yo-Han—his big, scary-looking classmate who's actually a pure-hearted sweetie. Can Yo-Han's simple love help commitment-phobic Ji-Hyun heal from the traumas of his past?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
